  <programDescriptions>
      <programName xml:lang="en">ArchiMate® Foundation and Practitioner training (3-day) — accredited, including two official exams during the training</programName>
      <programSummaryText xml:lang="en">Accredited ArchiMate training (parts 1 + 2): two training days plus a separate exam day, including both official exams on site.</programSummaryText>
      <programDescriptionText xml:lang="en">Hands-on, accredited ArchiMate® training in which you learn to apply the modelling language for enterprise architecture: the layers, the core concepts and the viewpoints used to capture and communicate an architecture. The training covers part 1 (Foundation) and part 2 (Practitioner) and consists of two consecutive training days plus a separate exam day, with a weekend in between to study. You sit both official exams on site on that exam day; exam retake insurance can be added optionally.</programDescriptionText>
  </programDescriptions>

